<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<% const faqs = [
  ["How does booking work?", ["Choose your dates and number of guests, then send a request. The host has 48 hours to accept or decline. Your dates are held only once the host confirms."]],
  ["When do I pay?", ["You pay the host at the property. Wanderlust takes no payment online. Taxes are not included; the host will confirm any applicable taxes."]],
  ["How do I cancel?", ["Open the booking from Trips and choose Cancel. You can cancel any time before the check-in day. The host is told by email."]],
  ["What do Flexible, Moderate and Strict mean?", ["Each listing has one cancellation policy, shown on the listing page and on your request. Flexible is free up to 24 hours before check-in, Moderate up to 5 days, and Strict up to 14 days. If a confirmed booking is cancelled after that, it is recorded as a late cancellation and both of you can see it. No money moves, because Wanderlust takes no payment. The Cancellation Policy page has the full wording."]],
  ["Where do I find the house rules?", ["Every listing shows its house rules, check-in and check-out times, quiet hours and cancellation terms before the booking panel. Read them before you send a request. If you see Ask the host, the host has not filled that in yet."]],
  ["Why can't I see the exact address?", ["Before a stay is confirmed, a listing shows the city and country and a circle of about 500 m on the map. Once the host confirms your stay, the address and exact pin appear on your booking."]],
  ["How do I list my place?", ["Log in, confirm your email address, switch to host mode with the button in the header, and choose Create listing. One form asks for the basics, location, space, pricing, stay rules, amenities and photos. You can save a draft that only you can see and publish when it is ready. Publishing needs every required field, at least one photo, and a map pin or your agreement to go without one. Block the dates you are away after you save. New requests arrive under Reservations and by email."]],
  ["Why is my listing asking me to complete its details?", ["Your stay was listed before we asked for the full address, stay rules and cancellation terms. We filled in what we could, and your listing stays visible. Open it from the prompt on your Hosting page, check each section and save."]],
  ["What are guest mode and host mode?", ["One account does both. In guest mode you browse, save stays, send requests and see your trips. In host mode you see your listings, create a listing and answer reservations. You choose where to start when you sign up, you can change that default in your profile settings, and the Switch button in the header changes your mode at any time. If a page belongs to the other mode, we tell you and show where to switch."]],
  ["Who can see my profile and my email?", ["Your public profile shows your display name, username, photo, short bio, city and country, languages, the month you joined and whether your email is verified. If you host, it lists your stays; if you have reviewed stays, it lists your reviews. It never shows your email, bookings, saved stays or password. A host and a guest see each other's email only on the page of a confirmed booking between them, and not after it is cancelled. You choose what goes on your profile from your Profile page."]],
  ["I forgot my password", ["Use the Forgot password link on the sign-in page. We will email you a link that works once and lasts an hour."]],
  ["Why do I need to confirm my email?", ["We need a working address to tell you about your bookings. You can browse and save stays without it, but you need it to send a request or list a stay."]],
  ["How do I delete my account?", ["Open your Profile, scroll to Delete account. If you have upcoming confirmed stays, cancel them first. You can download a copy of your data from the same page."]],
  ["How do I report a problem?", ["Use the contact form below and choose Report a problem. If you feel unsafe, call the local emergency services first."]],
]; %>
<div class="wl-page wl-page--read">
  <h1 class="wl-page-title">Help</h1>
  <p class="wl-page-lede">Short answers to the questions we hear most.</p>
  <div class="wl-disclosure-group">
    <% for (const [question, answers] of faqs) { %>
    <details class="wl-disclosure">
      <summary><%= question %></summary>
      <% for (const answer of answers) { %><p><%= answer %></p><% } %>
    </details>
    <% } %>
  </div>
  <div class="wl-empty">
    <span class="wl-state__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-regular fa-life-ring"></i></span>
    <h2 class="wl-empty__title">Still need help?</h2>
    <p class="wl-empty__text">Write to us and we will reply by email.</p>
    <a class="wl-auth-btn wl-auth-btn--primary" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
  </div>
</div>
